id: youtube-no-next
section: Sites
item: YouTube's next video does not play by itself: a 19 s video played by a tap ends, and for the next 70 s nothing plays — no play() allowed, the video paused at its end, the URL unchanged (the gate of jihad.youtube.stopAutoplay; with it off, YouTube navigates to a "mix"); the first tap's play went through
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=jNQXAC9IVRw
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true
kit: cavekit-device-headroom.md R4
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:video' 60
dismiss 384 346
wait line 'play() allowed' 15
probe playing '(function(){var v=document.querySelector("video");return JSON.stringify({paused:v.paused,t:Math.round(v.currentTime),url:location.href.slice(0,60)});})()'
expect probe-has '"paused":false'
wait quiet 'play() allowed' 70
probe after-the-end '(function(){var v=document.querySelector("video");return JSON.stringify({paused:v.paused,ended:v.ended,t:Math.round(v.currentTime),url:location.href.slice(0,60)});})()'
expect probe-has '"paused":true'
expect url jNQXAC9IVRw
